<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">Tutsa: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Jeems</para>
  <para style="toc1">JEEMS ih raang arah Le</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeems</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jms</para>
  <para style="mt1">JEEMS</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ih Raang Arah Le</para>
  <para style="imt">Ephangjatjih</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Jeems ih raangha le ah langla</char> “mongrep thoontang ni saapta la Rangte mina loong suh” amiimiidi reeraang pakna renbaat arah lomraang ha. Arah raangte warah ih amiimiidi renbaat adi Kristaan dang ajang nyia reeraang doh mongtham ese nyia lamsui tiit baat adi hejaat hejaat jenglam ih baat arah raangha. Kristaan mina ih changthih changteng, phate joonnaam, ese reeraang, lalang lajang tiit dande, tuumaang nyia mootkaat, paatjaajih jengkhaap, mongtham ese, rookmui jengmui, khuupook nyia toongtang tiit, mih dande tiit, engaam tiit, enaan tiit, nyia rangsoom tiit raangha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Arah le adi reeraang pakna ah tuumaang damdoh angtheng nyia Kristaan thooroom doh emah jangse reeraang theng ngeh ih raangha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Hemong Dowa Jatjih</para>
  <para style="io1">Ephangjatjih <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:1">1:1</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tuumaang nyia mongtham ese <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:2-8">1:2-8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Changthih changteng <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:9-11">1:9-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phate joonnaam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:12-18">1:12-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Echaat nyia reeraang <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:19-27">1:19-27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dandeemui thoidi choophaan <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tuumaang mootkaat <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristaan nyia tuihih <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristaan nyia Mongrep <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 4:1-5:6">4:1—5:6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hejaat hejaat renbaat <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 5:7-20">5:7-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mk 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:13">Esm 15:13</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:19">Gal 1:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Rangte nyia Teesu Jisu Kristo laksuh, Jeems taangnawa:</para>
  <para style="p">Mongrep noongrep ni Rangte mina loong tiisoontla loong suh jengseera.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuumaang nyia mongtham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, sen taangnah jaatrep phate joonnaam thok haadoh khangraangse ngeh ih li an, <verse number="3" style="v"/>tiimnge liidi erah likhiik phate joonnaam ah sen tuumaang nawa ih jen tanno juuba, jirep adoh jen naan eh an. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sen ih jat etheng, jen naan ih tanno roidong doh jirep ah jen an, eno juuba tiim lampo nah uh sen epun nyia lasoot lasaam ang an. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Enoothong sengdung dowa o ang an bah uh mongtham ese laje kanbah, sen ih Rangte rangsoom an heh ih kot ehan; tiimnge liidi Rangte ih loongtang suh larat lapat thang ih minchan ih chokoha. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Enoothong mabah rangsoom an, tenchi lah angthang ih hanpi an. O tenchi angla erabah juusih ni pong ih juutak saapmot ah likhiik . <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sen loong emah mok ang anbah, nyia tiim re an bah uh sen thung nah lajen phanthun kanbah, <verse number="8" style="v"/>Teesu taangnawa echoh eh ih ngeh ih nakmok thun an.</para>
  <para style="s">Changthih nyia changteng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Changthih Kristaan loong ah Rangte ih toonjoh adoh tenroon ang theng, <verse number="10" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6">Isa 40:6</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 40:7">7</ref> </char></note> adoleh changteng Kristaan loong ah Rangte ih datthiin ih adoh tenroon ang theng. Tiimnge liidi changteng ah woma ni popong kah mutdat ah likhiik ih mah ah. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Rangsa ah khaamloolo ih dong tahaano nyia mi taano bangphook ah tekraat eha; hepoong uh takah poongka, adoleh hejaase ah uh emat e ah. Erah likhiikkhiik changteng loong ah neng pheehoon mootkaat damdoh thet haat ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Thaak taari nyia phate joonnaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Phate joonnaam di o ih tuumaang roh eha erah juuba tenroon, tiimnge liidi erah thaak taari ha jen ano, heh mongnook loong asuh Rangte ih kakhamta jun ih hethaang ah roidong koh ah. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Erah likhiik thaak taari heedoh, seng ih mabah uh lajaatjaat jeng theng, “Arah thaak taari hali ah Rangte taangnawa.” Tiimnge liidi Rangte ah ethih ekhah ih tami thaak taari ka, he teewah ih o uh tathaak taari ka. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Enoothong seng tenthun ethih nyia nyamnyook ih dat hoom hali. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Eno seng tenthun ethih ekhah rah ih rangdah dongsam thukla nyia dongtup ha; erah lih adi rangdah ah hantek phong taano etek ih thukla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Joonte loong erah raangtaan ih naktoom mokwaan han! <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ranglakkot ese nyia epun lakkot ah rangmong nawa ra hala; rangmong dowa weephaak Dongsiitte Rangte reenawa ra hala, heh lekte tah angka nyia rangnak takah ngaak ang thukka. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hethung hetak nawa ih nyia heh jengkhaap amiisak nawa ih dongtup tahe, tiimnge liidi mathan dongsiitta erah loong tung dowa seng loong ah phangkhoh tiik arah potiik loong ang theng.</para>
  <para style="s">Echaat nyia reeraang pakna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Joonte loong, sen ih arah samthun roh etheng! Warep ih boichaat ah jaalo ih boichaat theng, enoothong ejeng nyia ekhat ah siak lakhat theng. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mina tenkhat ih Rangte kateng tenthun nyia mootkaat ah mabah uh tachoka. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih lalangka lampo ni jangse li dowa nyia ethih mootkaat loong dowa haloh ang theng. Jirep ah Rangte suh look anno sen tenthun ni tiimjaat jengkhaap dong thukla erah ah kaptheng, erah ih juuba jen puipang han.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Heh jengkhaap ah boichaat luulu ih anno sen teenuh teewah nak mokwaan an; erah nang ebah erah chaat han jengkhaap kap suh jangse an. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Sen ih jengkhaap ah boichaat luulu ih anno erah jun ih jangse lareeraang kanbah, theeri ni adoleh samsok ni o mina ih heh teenuh teewah likhiikkhiik ih japtup arah likhiik ih ang an. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Erah loong ah ebah neng teenuh teewah ah samkhikhih ih sok ano dokkhoom kala eno hethe hekhoh tiim likhiik angko taaja erah jaasiit di lak haat ha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Enoothong marah hootthe mina puipang suh epunthoon ah, labeehaat thang ih erah hootthe ah kap anbah nyia boichaat luulu lah ethang ih jangse ih reeraang pakna anbah—sen tiim re an erah doh Rangte ih romseetam kohan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>O ih bah uh sen jaachi ni ngah thooroom mina ngeh ih tam thun han? Heh tuihih ah laplap ih moot abah heh thooroom ah thaangmuh, erabah heh teeteewah ba mokwaan ha. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Sen loong Wah Rangte ih kilingling<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilingling; mararah hah tajengka: arah suh eng ih pure liiha</char></note> nyia amiimi thooroom liiha abah amah suh liiha: numuh wamuh nyia numuh jooti loong ah neng chamchoh doh chosok theng adoleh arah mongrep dowa mih thet hoomjih loong dowa haloh ang theng.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lah dandeemui raangtaan ih choophaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Joonte loong, chaan aphaan Teesu, Teesu Jisu Kristo suh hanpiite loong, rangkhonah sok an jun ih o mina ang abah uh nak liilaangmui an. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Jengthaak asuh changteng warah ah kom laktiip nyia nyuse khatmi ah kap ano ngoongthum theng ni wang hala, erah damdi changthih warah uh nyutu khattu ah kap ano wang hala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>An ih nyuse khatmi kapte asuh choomjoh uno “Tongtheng eseethoon adoh tong uh mokbaat ubah,” enoothong changthih warah suh “Erah doh chap uh, adoleh nga lathong nah erah hah adoh tong uh mokbaat ubah,” <verse number="4" style="v"/>erabah sen jaachi ni ethih tenthun nawa ih mok dandeemui elan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nga mongnook joonte loong, boichaat thaak an! Rangte ih arah mongrep dowa changthih loong ah tuumaang nah changteng angthuk suh danjeeta, eno heh ih minchanha loong asuh kakhamta jun ih ranghasong adoh chotong thuk ah. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Enoothong sen loong ah ih changthih ah tachoom jokan! Mat hoonte jiinni hoomkaat hanno sen suh liilaangte ah o ah? Changteng loong ah laanglek! <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sen suh kohalan men ese thetbaatte ah neng loong laanglek ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew 19:18</ref> </char>
    </note> Hasong hootthe ah kap anbah sen loong ah epunjih ah re an, erah rangteele ni uh emah ju liiha, “Senkhung sentok ah senteewah minchan han ah likhiik ih minchan theng.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Enoothong sen ih o mina ang abah uh rangkhoh nah sok anno mok liilaang anbah, sen loong ah rangdajih re lan, eno Hootthe jundi hootthe thetsiitte ngeh ih dut haat han. <verse number="10" style="v"/>O ih jengdang esiit thetsiit ah erabah jengdang thoontang thetsiitte eh hoonla. <verse number="11" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Hpkt 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Hodb 5:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Hpkt 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Hodb 5:17</ref></char></note>Tiimnge liidi, “Misah minuh damdoh laroomjup theng,” emah liite warah ih liiha, “Mih latek haat theng” ngeh ih uh li eha. An misah minuh damdoh laroomjup ko bah uh, an ih mitek haat ubah hootthe thetsiitte ih hoonlu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Senjeng senkong nyia senmoot senkaat ah seng puipangte hootthe ih dande ha mina likhiik ih ang theng. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tiimnge liidi o tenthet lajeeka mina ah Rangte ih dande adoh heh suh tenthet tajeeka ang ah; enoothong tenthet jeete ah dande sa echo ejih tajeeka ang ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuumaang nyia reeraang pakna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, sen loong dung dowa o ih bah uh sen reeraang pakna lajeeka bah tuumaang ah ese nih ang ah? Erah tuumaang ah ih puipang tam ehan? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Jengthaak asuh soophoh soonah nyumuh khatmuh nyia phakmuh satmuh tongla. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tiimma se ah neng suh jengkhaap huuta nawa ih emah li ubah ah, “Rangte ih romseetam toom kohan! Lomjaaja nyia wokphoot wokbi toom tong an!”—neng suh neng roidong di tiim laakiila erah lakoh koobah ah? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih tuumaang damdoh lakkot eje angjih: reeraang pakna laje thang ih tuumaang luulu je abah, erabah tekmang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Enoothong mararah ih liiha, “Mina wasiit asuh tuumaang jeela, wasiit asu reeraang pakna jeela.” Ngah ih liihang, “Ngah suh noisok thaak he reeraang pakna lajeeka bah tuumaang mamah mi je ah. Nga tuumaang ah nga reeraang pakna nawa ih noisok ha.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Sen ih Rangte ah esiit ngeh ih hanpi tam ehan? Ese laang angja! Erabah hakhoh luuwang ih uh hanpi eha—nyia mootcho ela. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Sen loong ah engak elan! Sen reeraang pakna lajeeka bah tuumaang ah thaangmuh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20</char><char style="fq" closed="false">thaangmuh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni </char><char style="fq" closed="false">etek liiha. </char></note> ang ah ngeh ih noisok ah tamjam han? <verse number="21" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Rangph 22:1-14</ref> </char></note> Sengte senwah Abraham ah Rangte ngathong ni mamah kateng angta? Heh sah Isak romthong ni khojoop taat kowanta, erah di heh reeraang nawa ih noisokta. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Sen ih tatam tupkan? Erah di heh tuumaang nyia heh reeraang ah eroom ih mokala; heh tuumaang ah heh reeraang jun ih epunthoon ngeh ih noisok ha. <verse number="23" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Rangph 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:7">2Tet 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa 41:8</ref> </char></note> Eno Rangteele ni liiha ah amiisak ih angla, “Abraham ih Rangte hanpiita, eno heh tuumaang jun ih Rangte ih Abraham ah kateng ngeh ih kapta.” Erah thoidi Abraham suh Rangte joonte ngeh ih poonta. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, sen ih tup ehan, heh reeraang pakna jun ih ba Rangte ngathong ni erah mina ah kateng eh hoonta, heh tuumaang laklak ih tami angka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 2:1-21">Jms 2:1-21</ref> </char>
    </note>Hansangte Rahap ah uh emamah ju angta. Heh reeraang pakna jun ih Rangte damdi kateng eh hoonta, mamah ih hoonta liidi bah, Rahab ih Ijirel mijokjengte ah noppoon ano lamhoh ko nawa ih hotsoon thuk rumta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, sakphu adoh chiiala lajeeka di tekmang angla likhiikhiik, reeraang pakna laje thang ih tuumaang luulu je abah erabah tekmang.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Tuihih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nga joonte loong, sen loong ah thoontang nyootsootte totoh angtheng ngeh ih tah angka. Sen ih jat ehan, wahoh nang ih nyootsootte seng loong ah sattitih ih dande he. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tiim saasa di seng loong ah mokre eli. Enoothong o mina heh jengkhaap ni lamok jengka, erabah epunthoon ang ah eno heh sakpuh thoontang jen riikoi sokboi ah. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mok ah seng jeng chaat thuk suh heh tui ni moot hoom theng ben hi, eno seng manah kaat theng ah erah di kaat thukli. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Adoleh juukaari ah taat samthun thaak ih: mathan rak taat ang abah uh pong ih jen lengmot eha, enoothong heh ngoomrop theng banglo rah ih jen lenghoomha, eno juukaari jopte ah mani kaat thung ah erah di jen kala. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Erah likhiikkhiik tuihih ah: ehinsah taat ang abah uh, jirep adi elonglongwah ih jengkongla.</para>
  <para style="p">Taat samthun thaak an woma erathan rak ah weepoong amasah ih jen khaam la! <verse number="6" style="v"/>Eno tuihih ah we likhiikkhiik. Mongrep ni ethih thoon ah tuihih ah, eno seng sakphu ni tong ano seng sak ni ethih ekhah loong ah jaatjaang thukla. Seng roidong roitang erah we ah ih roitang khaam thukla eno tuihih heheh erah we adi khaamla marah soolam nawa ra hala rah ih ah. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mina ih jirep ah jen jijaang hi eno jihoh si anyah loong uh jen jik eha—woma si siiawi nyia woh angkoja, adoleh pu ajuk nyia nyah tiimjih angkoja. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Enoothong o ih uh tuihih maang taat mi jika. Tuihih ah ethih nyia lajen riikoi sokboi theng, hetaang ni me asu ethithoon ah ba je ah. <verse number="9" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Rangph 1:26</ref> </char></note>Erah tuihih ah seng Teesu nyia seng Wah suh lakookmi li suh maak ehi eno mina Rangte likhiikkhiik ih dongsiit ha ah uh etam ehi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Jengseera nyi etam jengkhaap ah tui phoosiitsiit nawa dokjengla. Joon awaan loong emah bah lah ang theng! <verse number="11" style="v"/>Juumik esiit nawa ju esum nyia ekhah tami dong janka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, phuksak bang nawa mabah uh olip tiik tami tiikka; adoleh anggut tiik nawa mabah uh phuksak tiik tami tiikka, adoleh sum juumik nawa juusum tami dong janka.</para>
  <para style="s">Mongtham ese ah rang nawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Sen loong dung dowa o bah esekthoon nyia ejat esam eje tam ah? Emah ang abah heh roidong ese nawa ih, hemoot hekaat mongtham ese nyia seklilih jun ih noisokjih. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Enoothong senten senmong nah miksuk kiitnoot, ethih ekhah, nyia nyamnyook je abah, an mongtham ese asuh khuupook uno amiitiit ngathong nah nak dah uh. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Erah likhiik mongtham abah rangmong nawa tah angka; erabah mongrep raangtaan ih ba ang ah, erah chiiala ah ese tah angka nyia hakhoh luuwang jiin nawa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Maradi miksuk khaada nyia nyamnyook jeela, erah di hoongrok haphaang nyia ethih ekhah jaatrep ah jeeroh ela. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Enoothong mongtham rang nawa ang abah jaakhothoon ah kilingling ang ah; semroongroong nyia seklilih ang ah, sano joonte totoh je ah, mih minchan totoh ang ah; eno hemoot hekaat nah ese totoh ang ah; lonoite uh tah angka nyia mih dandeete uh tah angka ang ah. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Esejih mathan ah erah semroongroong mokaatte loong ih dongthukla.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mongrep damdi joonte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sen jaachi ni rookmui jengmui loong ah manawa thok hala? Erah loong ah hansi tenroon raangtaan ih sen ten ni tongthuk thoidi, sen jaachi ni rookmui jengmui pak anglan. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Sen loong ah ih jirep ah jam han, enoothong erah loong ah tachoh kan, erah thoidi tek haat esuh bansok han; sen loong ah ih chichangchang taat jam han, enoothong erah loong ah tachoh kan, erah tungkaangdi changrook anglan. Sen loong ah ih marah jam han tachoh kan tiimnge liidi sen ih Rangte jiin nawa erah tasuh kan. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Adoleh mabah suh an erah di tachoh kan, tiimnge liidi sen tenthun ah ethih; jirep jaatrep sen ih jam han ah sen teenuh teewah hansi tenroon nah maak suh jam han. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Tuumaang lajeete mina loong! Sen loong ah ih tatam jatkan mongrep damdi joon awaan angla rah Rangte piiara ngeh ah? Sen loong ah ih mongrep damdi joon awaan angsuh liihan abah, sen teenuh teewah ah Rangte piiara ba eh hoon an. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Rangteele ni amah liiha ah amiisak tah angka ngeh ih nakmok thun an, “Rangte ih seng sak ni Chiiala tong thukla rah ih ramram ih thun ha.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chiiala…kamkam ih thun ha; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seng sak ni Rangte ih chiiala pathuk hala ah ramram ih sok ha.</char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Tittk 3:34</ref></char></note> Enoothong Rangte ih tenthet kohali ah erah nang eh ju echaan thoon. Rangteele ni amah liiha, “Rangte ih khuupookte ah tanookka enoothong toongtang loong ah suh minchan koha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih sen teenuh teewah ah Rangte suh look an. Hakhoh luuwang ah naknop thuk an, eno sen reenawa heh esoon e ah. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Rangte reenah thok han, eno heh sen reenah thok ha. Rangdah mina sen loong ah ih, sen lak ah saatiihaat ih an! Lonoite sen loong ah ih, senten senmong ah esa angthuk an! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Thungthet e an, ehu e an, mikphi janhaat an; ten ni engit e lan ah ehu e thuk an, sen tenroon ah nak roon thuk an! <verse number="10" style="v"/>Sen teenuh teewah Teesu ngathong nah ehin ih hoon an, sen loong ah tonjoot ehan.</para>
  <para style="s">Kristaan phoh ano dandeemui thoidi choophaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Phoh ano loong, wasiit ih wasiit nak lenmakmui theng. An ih Kristaan wahoh mok lenmak ubah adoleh dande ubah, an ih Hootthe ba lenmak hu adoleh dande hu. An ih Hootthe dande ubah, Hootthe kapte takah angko, enoothong Hootthe dandeete ih hoonlu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hootthe dongthukte nyia dandeete Rangte heh luulu. Heh ih luulu jen puipang ah nyia thet haat ah. Mih dande suh an o ngeh ih thun hu?</para>
  <para style="s">Khuupook thoidi choophaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 27:1">Tittk 27:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Emah liite loong ah ih, nga jeng ah boichaat an, “Chiinnyah lah angka bah uh rangkhah seng loong ah samnuthung nah tumkhoom kah ih, erah doh seng pangsiit than tong kah eno pheehoon mootkaat ah kah, eno ngun hantek bi kah ih.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Rangkhah an roidong ah mamah ang ah erah uh tajatko! An weekhot kah nyaamkhoom ah likhiik, erah pootsiit ba khot ah esaapmat eh ah. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Sen loong ah amah jeng theng tan: “Teesu thung ang abah, seng loong ah songtong eno jirep jaatrep moot ah mokah ih.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Enoothong sen loong ah amadi khuupook elan; engaam elan; emah ngaam lan abah tapunka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, mootse kaatse ah ese ngeh ih jat eno lare keebah, rangdah ni moongli.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Changteng tungthoidi choophaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Eno amadoh, changteng sen loong ah ih nga jeng ah boichaat an! Sen loong taangnah chamthih naangkhah thok e hala asuh mikphi janhaat an! <verse number="2" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:19">Mat 6:19</ref></char></note> Sen loong changteng ah ram ih sot ha, nyia sennyuh senkhat ah khunchoong ih saha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Senhun senkom loong ah ram ih sot ha, eno erah ram ah sen haaki ang ah eno we ih matkhaam ah likhiik ih sen si ah matphak han. Amadi rangwu thoonkaat damdam eh nyam acham ah lomthiin ehan. <verse number="4" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:14">Hodb 24:14</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 24:15">15</ref></char></note> Sen phek ni mootkaatte loong asuh lakbi thaang uh takoh kan. Nenghu nengri ah boichaat ih an! Sen chamkhante hu ari ah Teesu Elong Rangte na ni thokla. <verse number="5" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:14">Hodb 24:14</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 24:15">15</ref></char></note>Arah hah adi sen roidong ah hansi tenroon ni laboot labe ih tonglan. Tek haat rangwu raangtaan eba sen teenuh teewah ah totjook han. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Sen ih nokbaang toongtang loong ah dut haat ehan nyia tek haat ehan, eno neng tangaak jengra. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nokbaang tongtang loong ah dut haat han nyia tek haat han, eno neng tangaak jengra; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mina loong ah tangaak jengka. Rangte ah tatam ngaakjeng ka? </char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Enaan nyia rangsoom tiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, erah raangtaan ih, Teesu maang raara banban ih bantong theng. Phek mootkaatte ah taatsok thaak an, heji hecham se thuk suh heh phek ah banban ih bansok ha. Heh ih moihu nyia sonop rangphaat ah bansokroh eha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Sen uh emamah ih bansok theng. Sen loong laalom ah rongtangtang ang theng, timnge liidi Teesu kaat rangwu ah ethok e hala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, Rangte ih naktoom dande han suh, sen jaachi nah wasiit ih wasiit nak thetbaat liilaangmui an. Dande te warah dongkhoom nanah e hala nyia thok esuh bantongla. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, Teesu mendi jengkongta khowah loong ah dokthun an. Neng loong ah chamnaang damdi tiimthan naan rumta loong ah tiitthaak ih kap an. <verse number="11" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21-22">Jb 1:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:10">2:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:8">Rsb 103:8</ref></char></note> Neng loong ah ih jen naan thoidi neng suh tenroon ngeh ih poon hi. Sen ih Job ih mathan naanta erah echaat ehan, eno lithoon ni Job suh Teesu ih mamah ih kota erah uh jat ehan. Tiimnge liidi Teesu ah mih minchante nyia tenthette.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:34-37">Mat 5:34-37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Joon awaan loong, thoontang nang ih jat ejih angla kakham andoh thoom lahoon theng. Rang mendoh angkoja, hah mendoh angkoja adoleh tiimjaat mendoh ankoja lathoom theng. Sen ih thang ih andoh “Em” luulu li theng, adoleh edaan ih andoh “tah angka” luulu li theng, eno juuba Rangte ih tadande ru.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Sen jaachi ni cham anaangte eje tam ah? Neng loong ah ih rangsoom theng. Sen loong chamchi ni o bah uh tenroonte eje tam ah? Neng loong ah ih rangphoong rangsoom bongkaat bong theng. <verse number="14" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:13">Mk 6:13</ref></char></note> Sengdung ni khoisatte o ang abah uh eje tam ah? Neng ih chaas mihak phokhoh loong ah poontheng, neng loong ah ih rangsoom koh ano khoisatte sak nah olip thi ih Teesu mendoh hut theng. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tuumaang ano soom adi khoisatte ah ede ela; eno Teesu ih hesak hesi ah de thuk ano heh ih rangdah reeta ah biin anaan hoon ah. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, wasiit ih wasiit mokre ah ebaatmui etheng eno rangsoom kotmui theng, eno juuba sen loong ah ede ih an. Mina eseete rangsoom adi chaan aphaan jeela. <verse number="17" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Lu 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:1">18:1</ref></char></note> Elija ah seng likhiikkhiik mina angta. Heh ih rang naktoom phaat ah ngeh ih hethung hetak ah koh ano rangsoomta, eno hah ni paangjom paangthom rang taphaatta. <verse number="18" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:42-45">1Lu 18:42-45</ref></char></note> Eno rangphaat raangtaan ih rang we soom kano, rangphaat ah we phaat, ji acham loong ah seemi eta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, sengdung dowa o bah uh amiisak lampo dowa doksoon ano wahoh ih ngaaksiit haabah, <verse number="20" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Tittk 10:12</ref></char></note> arah samthun an: o mina ih rangdah mina lalangka lam nawa ngaaksiit ha bah rangdah mina la<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">rangdah mina la; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">heh teewah la. </char></note> ah etek nawa puipangha eno rangdah hantek saasiit ha.</para>
</usx>
